// Compiler-owned relationship between provider-backed opaque semantics and a
// concrete physical carrier. The relationship is inert until the authoritative
// build selects one exact named conformance. Selection does not import carrier
// cleanup: v1 admits only a compiler-proven inert closed carrier, while the
// opaque declaration remains the sole semantic lifecycle authority. The
// carrier, not source-authored ABI numbers, supplies representation.

pub trait OpaqueRepresentation<Opaque> {
}
